event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":94,"item_id":"rs_0be400a373b16d44016acc322422d08197ac723f851d9055fe","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Evaluating migration tests**\n\nI'm thinking about how to approach the migration tests and whether to add a seed before the existing schema. I wonder if separating the migration test and using DatabaseSync makes sense, along with seeding before running the existing test. Changing the identity during this process could complicate things, so maybe using a separate test with duplicated helpers or executing tests on a different port would work better. Prioritizing tests to append existing ones might require keeping migrations separate too."}

